#### Callback Interfaces

##### `BatchListener`

Callback interface carrying composite payloads and objects

Implemented in JS as an object with the methods below. Passed as an `i32` context key plus an `i32` pointer to the static `weaveffi_edge_cases_BatchListener_vtable` vtable; the vtable's trailing `free(ctx)` entry releases the JS object.

| Method | Parameters | Returns |
|--------|------------|---------|
| `onBatch` | `items: Outer[]`, `raw: Uint8Array`, `first: Outer | null`, `mode: Mode` | `void` |
| `onWidget` | `widget: Widget`, `fallback: Widget | null`, `children: Widget[]` | `void` |
| `onTick` | (none) | `void` |
| `shouldContinue` | `class: number` | `boolean` |
| `pickMode` | (none) | `Mode` |

##### `Keyword`

Callback interface whose name and methods are keywords

Implemented in JS as an object with the methods below. Passed as an `i32` context key plus an `i32` pointer to the static `weaveffi_edge_cases_Keyword_vtable` vtable; the vtable's trailing `free(ctx)` entry releases the JS object.

| Method | Parameters | Returns |
|--------|------------|---------|
| `delete` | `self: number` | `void` |
| `import` | (none) | `number` |

