#### Enums

##### `Legacy`

Deprecated enum with non-contiguous values and keyword-like variants

Passed as `i32` discriminant.

| Variant | Value |
|---------|-------|
| `None` | `0` |
| `Default` | `5` |
| `Class` | `10` |

##### `Mode`

Passed as `i32` discriminant.

| Variant | Value |
|---------|-------|
| `Fast` | `1` |
| `Safe` | `2` |

